banking77-tickets.csv
BANKING77, the test split, with a queue column added for this course.
The full dataset is 13,083 real customer-service queries labelled with 77
fine-grained intents ; the 3,080-row test split is what ships here.
source: https://github.com/PolyAI-LDN/task-specific-datasets
paper: Casanueva et al., "Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence Encoders", 2020
authors: PolyAI Limited
license: CC-BY-4.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
changes: only the 3,080-row test split is included, the "category" column is
renamed "intent", and a "queue" column groups the 77 intents into five desks.
